  {
   "op": "append",
   "sec": "dys-cause",
   "html": "<ul><li><b>Pyuria</b> (leukocytes on dipstick/microscopy)<ul><li>Bacteriuria &amp; hematuria (dipstick positive for nitrites if infected with enterobacteria): upper UTI/pyelonephritis (WBC casts), lower UTI/cystitis (WBC clumps)</li><li>No bacteriuria &amp; no hematuria (dipstick negative for nitrites): gonococcal, non-gonococcal (e.g. <i>Chlamydia</i>, <i>Trichomonas</i>)</li></ul></li><li><b>No pyuria</b> (no leukocytes on dipstick/microscopy)<ul><li>Urethritis: <i>Candida</i>, herpes simplex virus</li><li>Vaginitis: <i>Candida</i>, <i>Gardnerella</i>, neoplasm</li><li>Non-pathogenic: estrogen deficiency, interstitial cystitis, radiation cystitis</li></ul></li></ul>"
  }
 ],
